From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] gamefixes: Le Mans Ultimate: use builtin d3dx11_43

In VR the game loads a .cur cursor through D3DX. The native d3dx11_43 hands
it to Wine's WIC, which has no decoder for it, and the game crashes on the
failed load. The builtin d3dx11_43 has a CUR/ICO loader for this.

https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom/issues/944
---
diff --git a/gamefixes-steam/2399420.py b/gamefixes-steam/2399420.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c0a1d2e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gamefixes-steam/2399420.py
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+"""Game fix for Le Mans Ultimate"""
+
+from protonfixes import util
+
+
+def main() -> None:
+    """Use the builtin d3dx11_43 and its CUR/ICO loader, the game crashes in VR without it"""
+    util.winedll_override('d3dx11_43', util.OverrideOrder.BUILTIN)
